    ["1、每周每个副本会获得一定的<Highlight>讨伐奖励次数</>，玩家在击杀副本首领后，会增加<Highlight>讨伐奖励进度</>\n2、讨伐奖励进度<Highlight>积累满</>后，可领取一件当前副本<Highlight>未拥有的烙印装备或者外观奖励</>\n3、领取后，对应的进度将会扣除领奖所需的次数\n4、烙印装备的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：共次数的副本，共享讨伐奖励次数，每周每个首领增加1次\n5、外观的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：每个副本，每周每个首领增加2次，普通和困难难度共享次数"] = "1. Each dungeon will receive a certain number of <Highlight>Crusade Reward Counts</> every week. Players will increase their <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> after killing the dungeon boss. \n2. After the <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> is fully accumulated, you can claim a piece of <Highlight>unowned Imprint Equipment or cosmetic reward</> from the current dungeon. \n3. After claiming, the corresponding progress will deduct the number of counts required for claiming the reward. \n4. Imprint Equipment Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Dungeons with shared counts share Crusade Reward Counts, and each boss adds 1 count per week. \n5. Cosmetic Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Each dungeon adds 2 counts per boss per week, and Normal and Hard difficulties share counts.",
