    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-参与与准备】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>进入方式：</>完成引导任务后，可前往城堡火车区域与肖恩对话，或从城堡/家园相关入口进入铁路大亨页面。\n<Assistant_Title2>出发条件：</>需要消耗<Assistant_Property1>经销许可证</>，如有城堡工坊产物，可以进一步提升初始票券。开局时携带产物会按配置价格兑换为初始<Assistant_Property2>商会票券</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>准备建议：</>优先携带本周推荐品类或当前难度对应等级的产物，推荐品类会获得更高的收益；"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Participation and Preparation】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Entry Method: </>After completing the tutorial quest, you can go to the Castle train area to talk to Sean, or enter the Railway Tycoon page from the Castle/Home related entrances. \n<Assistant_Title2>Departure Conditions: </>Requires consuming <Assistant_Property1>Distribution Licenses</>. If you have Castle Workshop products, you can further increase your initial tickets. When starting, carried products will be exchanged for initial <Assistant_Property2>Chamber of Commerce Tickets</> according to the configuration price. \n<Assistant_Title2>Preparation Suggestions: </>Prioritize carrying the recommended categories for the week or products corresponding to the current difficulty level; recommended categories will yield higher returns;",
